## Hints for Future Agents
- When editing a vendored .patch by hand: modifying an existing +line is
  count-neutral; ADDING lines requires bumping that hunk's +count in the
  @@ header. Later hunks' +start offsets self-heal (git apply tolerates
  offsets) but re-verify with git apply --check against the pinned base.
- The diffstat block at the top of the patch file is cosmetic (git apply
  ignores it); we left it stale deliberately.

